# Precision Studio Design

## Tokens
- Ink `#0B1220`, Paper `#F3F0EA`, Accent `#0F766E`, Steel `#64748B`, Sand `#D6C7A1`
- Display: Syne · Body: IBM Plex Sans (+ Arabic)

## Hard rules
- Brand name is hero-level; do not let a generic headline overpower it
- Full-bleed atmospheric hero (grain + mesh); photo is dominant visual anchor
- No floating badges/stat chips on the photo; no hero cards
- Prefer case-study rows over card grids
- One job per section
- Avoid purple gradients, cream+terracotta serif clichés, neon cyberpunk, rounded-full pill spam

## Motion budget
1. Hero name + photo reveal
2. Project row hover/slide
3. Section scroll fade
Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
